ack  instead old man Captain America is  waiting on a bench he explains that he  stayed back in time and the Risser  brothers have explained that he did in  fact create an alternate timeline but he  simply returned to this timeline at the  end to give Falcon the Captain America  shield so he can become the new Captain  America this is something that happens  in the comics in fact Bucky also becomes  Captain America at some point in time in  the comics as well which is why we see  Falcon look at Bucky and Bucky gives a  nod of approval saying that it's okay  you can be Captain America this is  something that will most likely see play  out in the new Bucky and Falcon TV  series on Disney Plus and of course we  find out that Steve finally got his  dance with Peggy Carter married her and  lived out his life happily and of course  after the credits we hear a clanking  noise this is a reference to the very  first Iron Man film where iron man makes  the very first Mach one Iron Man suit  that was the very first movie that  started the MCU and Avengers in game is  the movie that is wrapping up the story  arc for the first eleven years of the  MCU so the post credit scene brings it  full circle and that's it for my  complete breakdown of Avengers in game  and all of its Easter eggs I hope you  enjoyed it let me know what you think  about Avengers and game in the comments  down below if you're new to my channel  be sure to subscribe so you can stay up  to date on everything relating to  Avengers in game all things Marvel and  all things superhero as always thank you  all so much for watching  woof woof  congratulations to your desperation to  save the universe you killed half of its  population yeah you did it very nice and  dull it took you said it cost you  everything while crying like a baby now  you're it
 

